## Part IV — Judges: The Spread of Contamination

### Chapter 8: Micah — The First Failure of Containment
- Ephraimite theft
- Idolatry born from restitution
- Levite proximity as false legitimacy

### Chapter 9: Dan — Mobile Contamination
- 600 men as breach carriers
- Seizure of idol and priest
- False assurance of divine presence
- Destruction of a peaceful people
- Disappearance of Dan

### Chapter 10: Benjamin — National-Scale Breach
- Seizure of the Levite’s concubine
- “Folly in Israel” and corporate guilt
- Civil war as Joshua 7 scaled up
- Survival of 600 men
- Forced inheritance and curse preservation

