## Part V — Legalization of the Breach

### Chapter 11: Ruth and the Levirate Mask
- Mahlon the Ephrathite
- Refusal of the nearer kinsman
- Boaz’s claim
- Invocation of Perez as justification
- Obed assigned to Judah, not Joseph

### Chapter 12: Chronicles’ Confession
- Birthright belongs to Joseph
- Judah “prevails”
- Kingship as overpowering, not right

